{"step_index":199,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-31T03:28:28Z","thinking":"Standard Excel orange representations vary: `#FFFFA500`, `#FFF8CBAD`, or `#FFFFC000`. Considering the Korean context, \"주황색\" aligns with `#FFA500` or the Excel accent `#F4B084`. The goal is determining which color best represents \"주황색\".\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"node -e \\\"\\nconst ExcelJS = require('exceljs');\\n\\nasync function applyOrangeHighlight() {\\n  const filePath = 'C:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\lg\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\오늘\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\(데이터검증팀)실사 DB 취합_전달용_260720_배현명.xlsx';\\n  const backupPath = 'C:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\lg\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\오늘\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\(데이터검증팀)실사 DB 취합_전달용_260720_배현명_backup_11847_12000.xlsx';\\n  \\n  console.log('Loading backup workbook...');\\n  const backupWb = new ExcelJS.Workbook();\\n  await backupWb.xlsx.readFile(backupPath);\\n  const backupSheet = backupWb.getWorksheet('기업 정보');\\n  \\n  console.log('Loading target workbook...');\\n  const targetWb = new ExcelJS.Workbook();\\n  await targetWb.xlsx.readFile(filePath);\\n  const targetSheet = targetWb.getWorksheet('기업 정보');\\n  \\n  const orangeFill = {\\n    type: 'pattern',\\n    pattern: 'solid',\\n    fgColor: { argb: 'FFFFA500' } // Standard Orange\\n  };\\n  \\n  let modifiedCellsCount = 0;\\n  \\n  for (let r = 11847; r <= 12000; r++) {\\n    const origRow = backupSheet.getRow(r);\\n    const newRow = targetSheet.getRow(r);\\n    \\n    // Check columns 1 to 58\\n    for (let c = 1; c <= 58; c++) {\\n      const origVal = origRow.getCell(c).value;\\n      const newVal = newRow.getCell(c).value;\\n      \\n      const normOrig = origVal === null || origVal === undefined ? '' : String(origVal).trim();\\n      const normNew = newVal === null || newVal === undefined ? '' : String(newVal).trim();\\n      \\n      // If cell was modified or newly populated\\n      if (normNew !== '' && normNew !== normOrig) {\\n        newRow.getCell(c).fill = orangeFill;\\n        modifiedCellsCount++;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    newRow.commit();\\n  }\\n  \\n  console.log('Total modified/added cells highlighted in orange:', modifiedCellsCount);\\n  console.log('Saving target workbook...');\\n  await targetWb.xlsx.writeFile(filePath);\\n  console.log('Successfully saved target workbook with orange highlights!');\\n}\\n\\napplyOrangeHighlight().catch(console.error);\\n\\\"\"","Cwd":"\"c:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\resilient-bardeen\"","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"5000","toolAction":"\"Highlighting modified cells in orange\"","toolSummary":"\"Apply orange fill to modified cells\""}}]}
{"step_index":200,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"RUNNING","created_at":"2026-08-31T03:28:34Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-31T12:28:34+09:00\nTool is running as a background task with task id: ee5104b6-03e7-4ad7-9556-78ec00557d2c/task-200\nTask Description: node -e \"\nconst ExcelJS = require('exceljs');\n\nasync function applyOrangeHighlight() {\n  const filePath = 'C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\lg\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\오늘\\\\\\\\(데이터검증팀)실사 DB 취합_전달용_260720_배현명.xlsx';\n  const backupPath = 'C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\lg\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\오늘\\\\\\\\(데이터검증팀)실사 DB 취합_전달용_260720_배현명_backup_11847_12000.xlsx';\n  \n  console.log('Loading backup workbook...');\n  const backupWb = new ExcelJS.Workbook();\n  await backupWb.xlsx.readFile(backupPath);\n  const backupSheet = backupWb.getWorksheet('기업 정보');\n  \n  console.log('Loading target workbook...');\n  const targetWb = new ExcelJS.Workbook();\n  await targetWb.xlsx.readFile(filePath);\n  const targetSheet = targetWb.getWorksheet('기업 정보');\n  \n  const orangeFill = {\n    type: 'pattern',\n    pattern: 'solid',\n    fgColor: { argb: 'FFFFA500' } // Standard Orange\n  };\n  \n  let modifiedCellsCount = 0;\n  \n  for (let r = 11847; r <= 12000; r++) {\n    const origRow = backupSheet.getRow(r);\n    const newRow = targetSheet.getRow(r);\n    \n    // Check columns 1 to 58\n    for (let c = 1; c <= 58; c++) {\n      const origVal = origRow.getCell(c).value;\n      const newVal = newRow.getCell(c).value;\n      \n      const normOrig = origVal === null || origVal === undefined ? '' : String(origVal).trim();\n      const normNew = newVal === null || newVal === undefined ? '' : String(newVal).trim();\n      \n      // If cell was modified or newly populated\n      if (normNew !== '' && normNew !== normOrig) {\n        newRow.getCell(c).fill = orangeFill;\n        modifiedCellsCount++;\n      }\n    }\n    newRow.commit();\n  }\n  \n  console.log('Total modified/added cells highlighted in orange:', modifiedCellsCount);\n  console.log('Saving target workbook...');\n  await targetWb.xlsx.writeFile(filePath);\n  console.log('Successfully saved target workbook with orange highlights!');\n}\n\napplyOrangeHighlight().catch(console.error);\n\"\nTask logs are available at: file:///C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/ee5104b6-03e7-4ad7-9556-78ec00557d2c/.system_generated/tasks/task-200.log\nYOU MUST TAKE ONE OF THE FOLLOWING TWO ACTIONS: A) either proceed to other relevant work (if any) or, B) simply update the user with a short message (that you have launched the command and will wait for it to finish) and end the turn.\n DO NOTHING ELSE."}
